<title>PHILIPPINES: Alcatel seals Manila phone contract.</title>
<headline>Alcatel seals Manila phone contract.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine firm Isla Communications Inc said on Sunday it had sealed a $42 million contract with Alcatel to boost its cellular phone network.</p>
<p>Islacom vice president Renato Garcia said delivery of the equipment was expected to begin in June.</p>
<p>The unlisted Islacom is aiming for an additional 100,000 subscribers by the end of the year. It currently has 48,000 users.</p>
<p>- Manila Newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
